3. Multi-tier Web App Deployment

Execution Steps
1.Launch frontend EC2 instance
2.Launch backend EC2 instance
3.Create RDS database
4.Connect backend with database
5.Configure frontend with backend
6.Test complete application

Project Overview
Deployed a multi-tier architecture separating frontend, backend, and database layers.

AWS Services Used
Amazon EC2
Amazon RDS
Load Balancer

Features
Layered architecture
Improved security
Better scalability

Architecture
Frontend → Backend → RDS Database
